SUMMARY:Organizational Structure
DESCRIPTION:University Leadership University Presidency University President: Chief executive responsible for university affairs Vice President for Scientific Affairs: Overseeing academic and research matters Vice President for Administrative Affairs: Overseeing administrative and financial matters Colleges The university includes 18 specialized colleges:\nMedical and Health Colleges College of Medicine College of Dentistry College of Pharmacy College of Nursing College of Veterinary Medicine Engineering and Science Colleges College of Engineering College of Science College of Computer Science and IT College of Agriculture College of Biotechnology Humanities and Social Sciences Colleges College of Education College of Education for Women College of Arts College of Law College of Administration and Economics College of Fine Arts College of Physical Education and Sports Sciences College of Archaeology Research Centers Research and Studies Center Computer Center Continuing Education Center Publishing and Documentation Center Administrative Departments Legal Affairs Department Internal Audit and Control Department Quality Assurance Department Public Relations and Media Department Student Affairs Department Scholarships and Cultural Relations Department 
