UID:12450c4904284b56762a4a75774191cb-en@qu.edu.iq
DTSTAMP:20260902T085317Z
DTSTART:00010101T000000Z
SUMMARY:Vision, Mission & Goals
DESCRIPTION:Vision To be a regionally pioneering and internationally recognized university in higher education, scientific research, and community service.\nMission Al-Qadisiyah University is committed to providing distinguished academic education and preparing qualified and specialized cadres through:\nProviding a stimulating educational environment for creativity and innovation Enhancing scientific research aimed at solving community problems Instilling ethical and national values in students Building effective partnerships with local and international institutions Strategic Goals 1. Academic Excellence Developing academic programs according to international standards Recruiting distinguished scientific competencies Providing modern and advanced learning resources 2. Scientific Research Supporting original and applied scientific research Encouraging publication in prestigious scientific journals Establishing specialized research centers 3. Community Service Providing consultations and services to public and private sectors Organizing continuing education and training programs Contributing to solving societal problems 4. Digital Transformation Digitizing administrative and academic processes Developing e-learning platforms Enhancing technological infrastructure 5. International Cooperation Expanding partnerships with global universities Exchanging academic and research experiences Participating in international conferences and events Core Values Integrity: Commitment to the highest standards of ethics and transparency Excellence: Continuous pursuit of quality and mastery Innovation: Encouraging creativity and critical thinking Collaboration: Working in team spirit and partnership Responsibility: Commitment to community and nation 
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
